      "text": "The total energy supplied to an electric motor is $E$. Energy $Q$ is wasted and the remaining energy does useful work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "What is the efficiency of the motor?"
    }
  ],
  "layout": "list",
  "options": {
    "A": [
